    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire a well-proportioned four-bedroom detached family home ideally positioned on Main Street in the popular town of Headford, Co. Galway. \r\nExtending to approximately 134 sq. m. (1,443 sq. ft.), this attractive two-storey residence offers generous and versatile accommodation, making it an ideal choice for families seeking space, convenience and easy access to Galway City.\r\nThe property is approached via a welcoming entrance hall, leading to a comfortable sitting room featuring an open fireplace and bespoke built-in units. A particularly appealing feature of the ground floor is the spacious family room, complete with a solid-fuel stove and sliding doors opening onto the paved patio, creating a natural space for family living and entertaining.\r\nThe kitchen is fitted with PVC cabinetry, Formica countertops and electrical appliances and benefits from a separate rear access door. A generous utility room provides additional storage and laundry facilities, together with the property's Firebird oil boiler.\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises four well-proportioned bedrooms, with several rooms benefiting from fitted wardrobes. The principal bedroom has the added benefit of an ensuite shower room, while the main bathroom and hotpress complete the first-floor accommodation. An attic access point is also provided from the landing.\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a paved patio, two side entrance gates and a separate outbuilding extending to approximately 17 sq. m., providing excellent additional storage space.\r\nConstructed in 1999 using block-and-plaster construction with an insulated cavity, the property benefits from PVC double-glazed windows and doors, oil-fired central heating, an open fireplace and solid-fuel stove.\r\nLocation\r\nThe property enjoys a highly convenient position on Main Street, Headford, placing the amenities and services of the town within easy reach. Headford offers a good range of shops, schools, services and recreational facilities, while Galway City is approximately 26 km away.\r\nThis is a well-located and spacious family home offering comfortable accommodation with excellent potential for its new owners."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "•\tA 4 bedroom two storey detached dwelling with outbuilding. \r\n•\tBuilt in the year 1999.\r\n•\tBlock and plaster style construction with an insulated cavity. \r\n•\tCut timber roof with felt and slate. \r\n•\tPvc facia, soffit and gutters.\r\n•\tPvc windows and doors with insulated glass.\r\n•\tOil central heating with radiators. \r\n•\tOpen fireplace.\r\n•\tPvc kitchen with formica counter tops and electrical appliances. \r\n•\tPublic water supply and public sewerage connection. \r\n•\tPaved Patio, Side entrance gates.\r\n•\tOutbuildings offering 17m² of storage area."
      },
